# Agent scratch output — never committed
superpowers/
.superpowers/

# Design docs, research, specs and plans — local only
docs/

# Local workspace config for developing this plugin (not product).
# The plugin declares superpowers/pr-review-toolkit as dependencies, so
# consumers do not need these.
.claude/*
# The repo's own instructions for people and agents working on the plugin. They live here,
# not at the root: the root is the plugin, and `claude plugin validate --strict` (the release
# gate) refuses a CLAUDE.md there because plugin users would never get it.
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
